  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like a way to be able to set up a scene in various maps (i.e. a three angle shot using the pins) and then be able to save it as a scene I could pull up whenever I revisit the map.  Instead of having to set the angles I would want every time I'm at the stage on the second floor of The Pug, I could hit a button and all three angles I had saved previously would appear in the world.   This would facilitate content creators and aid them in recording things like talent shows, in game podcasts, machinima, RP, and the like.  Also, adding more pins to the camera would be a welcome addition as well.",
